    "regime_notes": "Positive in 2020-2022 (IC 0.04543, 566 observations), weak but positive in 2023-2024 (0.01022, 404), and strongest in 2025-2027 (0.05127, 597). Interpret uncertainty conservatively due to 15-asset cross-section.",
